{"id":"b4a73e7703406240","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-symmetric-word-process.md","title":"Symmetric Processes","display":"df-symmetric-word-process — Symmetric Processes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-symmetric-word-process","aliases":["68-df-symmetric-word-process"],"display":"df-symmetric-word-process — Symmetric Processes","depends_on":["[[68-df-word-process]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§10 p.31 / PDF 40","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-construction-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-symmetric-word-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-symmetric-word-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-symmetric-word-process — Symmetric Processes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" href=\"?note=2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" title=\"68-df-word-process\">68-df-word-process</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10 p.31 / PDF 40"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-construction-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\)</span>；词和过程见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" href=\"?note=2c2f80ef5e90c5ab\" title=\"68-df-word-process\">68-df-word-process</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 是在下式中绑定的词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl((X,Y)\\in W\\Longrightarrow(Y,X)\\in W\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl((X,Y)\\in W\\Longrightarrow(Y,X)\\in W\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}_{68}(W):=W\\cup\\{(Y,X):(X,Y)\\in W\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sym}_{68}(W):=W\\cup\\{(Y,X):(X,Y)\\in W\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §10，印刷 p.31 / PDF p.40，symmetric 逐条要求反向产生式，W′ 则由加入所有反向产生式得到。Sym_68 是有限集的显式构造；没有断言任意过程对称化都保持有向可达性，原书仅对其特制模拟过程证明那一事实。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-word-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-word-process","status":"resolved","id":"2c2f80ef5e90c5ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$；词和过程见 [[68-df-word-process]]。$X,Y$ 是在下式中绑定的词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Process}_{68}(\\Omega,W)\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)\\;\\bigl((X,Y)\\in W\\Longrightarrow(Y,X)\\in W\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sym}_{68}(W):=W\\cup\\{(Y,X):(X,Y)\\in W\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1243,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a6560d8fe6fe304","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。词与可达性见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]；合同性见 [[68-thm-symmetric-reachability-congruence]]。四元组结构与词求值取 [[68-df-shoenfield-semigroup]] 的接口。$X\\in\\operatorname{Word}_{68}(\\Omega)$。"},{"id":"a757ce838695243e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymProcess}_{68}(\\Omega,W)$，见 [[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]。$\\operatorname{Reach}_{68}$ 见 [[68-df-word-process-reachability]]，词与连接取这些定义的同一 $\\Omega$。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-96","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-symmetric-word-process]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-symmetric-word-process]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-symmetric-word-process|df-symmetric-word-process — Symmetric Processes]]"}],"outgoing":["2c2f80ef5e90c5ab"]}